title: $:/mf/gen/Panel/trash panel
catalog: Panel
target: trash panel
summary: The trash panel type

!! Commands

* ``trash:delete`` — Trash: permanently delete the selected entry
* ``trash:empty`` — Trash: permanently delete every entry
* ``trash:find`` — Trash: jump to an entry by name
* ``trash:first`` — Trash: move to the first entry
* ``trash:last`` — Trash: move to the last entry
* ``trash:next`` — Trash: move down
* ``trash:prev`` — Trash: move up
* ``trash:refresh`` — Trash: reload the entries
* ``trash:restore`` — Trash: restore the selected entry
